    "text": "def prime_prime(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    function that takes a number and returns True if the number is prime, False otherwise, False otherwise\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 1:\n        return False\n    if n == 2:\n        return True\n    for i in range(2, int(n**0.5(n)+1)):\n        if n % i == 0:\n            return False\n    return True\n\ndef prime_length(string):\n    \"\"\"\n    function that takes a string and returns True if the string length is a prime number, False otherwise\n    \"\"\"\n\n    length = len(string)\n    if prime_prime(length):\n        return True\n    else:\n        return False\n",
